## Add Filter-tab highlight icon next to Search Value

Context: Graph Explorer's Filter tab Search Value could only drive a full
graph search. The canvas Find popup already highlights matching labels;
users needed the same highlight from the Search Value field.

Changes:

1. src/front/templates/partials/dtwin/_query_sigmagraph.html
   Icon-only highlighter button in an input group next to Search Value.
2. src/front/static/query/js/query-sigmagraph.js
   Shared _applyHighlightQuery(); Filter button uses sgFilterValue.
3. tests/units/front/test_explorer_highlight_search_value.py
   Contract that the button is icon-only and reads Search Value.

